{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The official book will be released in September 2025</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The free demo will be released in October 2025</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/4d91597720a04287f93324b94478da0c.avif?t=1759933169\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Absolutely deadly nightmare</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one of the Outlaws, you\u2019ll try to strike fear into rival gunslingers in fast-paced PVP battles, or fight for survival against hordes of man-eaters in cooperative game modes. Face ultimate challenges\u2014let your Colts roar and the blood flow. An arsenal of deadly weapons awaits you, whether in close combat or at long range, to wipe out your enemies once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/1f92fb9d81eb4f7176ac8e163c60a204.poster.avif?t=1759933169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/1f92fb9d81eb4f7176ac8e163c60a204.webm?t=1759933169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/1f92fb9d81eb4f7176ac8e163c60a204.mp4?t=1759933169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>The greed for gold</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There were rumours of a terrible disease, the dead would rise again after the illness to hunt the living. They were called man-eaters. But these were only rumours from the distant mining towns. It was said that the greed for gold had caused the rival gangs to dig too deep. Nobody could believe that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/02dd598f22a58e725b30c6ecbfc99250.poster.avif?t=1759933169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/02dd598f22a58e725b30c6ecbfc99250.webm?t=1759933169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/02dd598f22a58e725b30c6ecbfc99250.mp4?t=1759933169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>More, more and more!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the ever-growing hordes of death, fearsome monsters and other outlaws who, like you, want to live one day longer as humans. Set up the battles however you like, with bots, team death match or the classic zombie mode. And remember, every bullet counts! Money is no longer worth anything at this time, only ammunition.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664650?t=1759933169","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664650?t=1759933169","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/df53c688bf3fc779ccbe007b6ffc2b602454c713/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759933169","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/df53c688bf3fc779ccbe007b6ffc2b602454c713/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759933169","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_de