s to hunt the living. They were called man-eaters. But these were only rumours from the distant mining towns. It was said that the greed for gold had caused the rival gangs to dig too deep. Nobody could believe that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/02dd598f22a58e725b30c6ecbfc99250.poster.avif?t=1759933169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/02dd598f22a58e725b30c6ecbfc99250.webm?t=1759933169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/02dd598f22a58e725b30c6ecbfc99250.mp4?t=1759933169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>More, more and more!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the ever-growing hordes of death, fearsome monsters and other outlaws who, like you, want to live one day longer as humans. Set up the battles however you like, with bots, team death match or the classic zombie mode. And remember, every bullet counts! Money is no longer worth anything at this time, only ammunition.</p>","developers":["Phantomedia"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/b3e4d028769708569356500be736ac729a0c0870/header.jpg?t=1759933169","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Phantomedia. Published and distributed by Phantomedia. Deadland Outlaws and Phantomedia are registered trademarks of Phantomedia. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"